IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-SGLANG-JUMPFORWARD.

DATA DIVISION.
01 STREAM-LEN          PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 JUMP-TOKENS         PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 FORWARD-STEPS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 LATENCY-NS          PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-SGLANG-JUMP.
    IF STREAM-LEN == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE STREAM-LEN TO JUMP-TOKENS.
    DIVIDE 4 INTO JUMP-TOKENS.
    IF JUMP-TOKENS == 0
        MOVE 1 TO JUMP-TOKENS.
    END-IF.

    MOVE JUMP-TOKENS TO FORWARD-STEPS.
    MULTIPLY 2 BY FORWARD-STEPS.
    MOVE 350 TO LATENCY-NS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 FORWARD-STEPS.
    WEIGHT 30 JUMP-TOKENS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
